"""WellNest tea decks (Oct 16 2026): project 'Three Tea Lines' (house blends + packaging) and 'Partnership Teas'
(PowerHaus Pilates, Vanni Pilates, The Buds Station). Option = (label, desc, fact1, fact2, art).
art: "img:<key>" (Wikimedia Commons photo in img/wn-tea, credits.json) or "pk:<container>:<style>:<name>|<sub>" (drawn pack mockup, name-only text).
Partner facts used (web-checked Oct 16 2026): PowerHaus Pilates - two Chiang Mai branches (Green Park, The Backyard Mahidol), reformer/mat/barre/MOTR/Gyrotonic/Garuda, open 7 days.
Vanni Pilates - founded 2019 by Evan Jo and Jeni Kim, first professional Pilates studio in Chiang Mai, aims at 'harmony of external beauty and inner beauty', rehab and posture work.
The Buds Station - dispensary at 109/1 Photharam Rd, Chang Phueak (near Maya / Wat Jed Yod), lounge with a chill vibe, sells alcohol-free drinks.
Rules: no cannabis or hemp ingredients; The Buds Station blends are relaxation teas only; no partner logos (name-only text)."""
